<title>LATVIA: KAIJA REBOUNDS, SHARES MORE ACTIVE.</title>
<headline>KAIJA REBOUNDS, SHARES MORE ACTIVE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kaija on Tuesday regained some of</p>
<p>the ground it lost as the market was slightly more active.</p>
<p>Other gainers included Mangali, up to 1.15 from 1.05 lats</p>
<p>and Roja, which rose to 1.75 lats from 1.53 lats.</p>
